WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.400
Test 3. This is the IELTS listening test.

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:10.600
You will hear a number of different recordings and you will have to answer questions on what you hear.

00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:17.600
There will be time for you to read the instructions and questions and you will have a chance to check your work.

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:21.200
All the recordings will be played once only.

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:23.799
The test is in four parts.

00:00:23.799 --> 00:00:30.600
At the end of the test you will be given 10 minutes to transfer your answers to the answer sheet.

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:37.400
Now turn to part 1.

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:45.200
Part 1. You will hear a man called Jack giving advice to a friend about surfing holidays.

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:49.599
First you have some time to look at questions 1 to 6.

00:01:15.199 --> 00:01:27.400
Now listen carefully and answer questions 1 to 6.

00:01:27.400 --> 00:01:33.800
Jack, I'm thinking of taking the kids to the seaside on a surfing holiday this summer

00:01:33.800 --> 00:01:38.800
and I wanted to ask your advice, as I know you're such an expert.

00:01:38.800 --> 00:01:44.199
Well, I don't know about that. But yes, I've done a bit of surfing over the years.

00:01:44.199 --> 00:01:51.199
I'd thoroughly recommend it. I think it's the kind of holiday all the family can enjoy together.

00:01:51.199 --> 00:01:56.199
The thing about surfing is that it's great for all ages and all abilities.

00:01:56.199 --> 00:01:59.000
My youngest started when he was only three.

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:06.800
Wow! But it's quite physically demanding, isn't it? I've heard you need to be pretty fit.

00:02:06.800 --> 00:02:11.399
Yes, you'll certainly learn more quickly and won't tire as easily.

00:02:11.600 --> 00:02:18.000
Well, that should be OK for us. You've been surfing a few times in Ireland, haven't you?

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:23.600
Yes, there's some great surfing there which people don't always realise.

00:02:23.600 --> 00:02:28.800
And which locations would you recommend? There seem to be quite a few.

00:02:28.800 --> 00:02:33.000
Yes, there are loads. Last year we went to County Donegal.

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:36.600
There are several great places to surf there.

00:02:36.600 --> 00:02:42.399
What about in County Clare? I read that's also really good for surfing.

00:02:42.399 --> 00:02:47.600
Yes, it is. I've been there a few times. Most people go to Le Hinch.

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:53.199
My kids love it there. The waves aren't too challenging and the town is very lively.

00:02:53.199 --> 00:02:55.399
Are there good hotels there?

00:02:55.399 --> 00:03:02.199
Yes, some very nice ones. And there are also a few basic hostels and campsites.

00:03:02.199 --> 00:03:06.199
It's great if you need lessons, as the surf schools are excellent.

00:03:06.199 --> 00:03:07.600
Sounds good.

00:03:07.600 --> 00:03:12.800
Yes, and there's lots to see in the area, like those well-known cliffs.

00:03:12.800 --> 00:03:14.399
I've forgotten the name of them.

00:03:14.399 --> 00:03:17.399
Oh, don't worry. I can look them up.

00:03:17.399 --> 00:03:22.399
I've also been surfing in County Mayo, which is less well-known for surfing,

00:03:22.399 --> 00:03:28.000
but we had a really good time. That was a few years ago, when the kids were younger.

00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:31.600
There's a good surf school at Kareniski Beach.

00:03:31.600 --> 00:03:33.199
How do you spell that?

00:03:33.199 --> 00:03:43.800
C-A-R-R-O-W-N-I-S-K-E-Y

00:03:43.800 --> 00:03:45.000
OK.

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:50.399
I put the kids into the surf camp they run during the summer for 10 to 16-year-olds.

00:03:50.399 --> 00:03:53.600
Oh, right. How long was that for?

00:03:53.600 --> 00:04:00.199
Three hours every day for a week. It was perfect. They were so tired out after that.

00:04:00.199 --> 00:04:01.800
I can imagine.

00:04:01.800 --> 00:04:06.199
One thing we did while the kids were surfing was to rent some kayaks

00:04:06.199 --> 00:04:10.800
to have a look around the bay, which is nearby. It's really beautiful.

00:04:10.800 --> 00:04:13.000
Oh, I'd love to do that.

00:04:16.200 --> 00:04:22.600
Before you hear the rest of the conversation, you have some time to look at questions 7 to 10.

00:04:31.799 --> 00:04:35.799
Now, listen and answer questions 7 to 10.

00:04:37.799 --> 00:04:42.799
Now, the only time I went to Ireland, it rained practically every day.

00:04:42.799 --> 00:04:47.799
Hmm, yes, that can be a problem. But you can surf in the rain, you know.

00:04:47.799 --> 00:04:50.799
It doesn't have the same appeal somehow.

00:04:50.799 --> 00:04:53.799
Well, it's not as if you can't surf in the rain.

00:04:53.799 --> 00:04:56.799
It's not as if you can't surf in the rain.

00:04:56.799 --> 00:04:58.799
But you can surf in the rain, you know.

00:04:58.799 --> 00:05:01.799
It doesn't have the same appeal somehow.

00:05:01.799 --> 00:05:05.799
Well, the weather's been fine the last couple of years when I've been there.

00:05:05.799 --> 00:05:11.799
But actually it tends to rain more in August than in the spring or autumn.

00:05:11.799 --> 00:05:15.799
September's my favourite month because the water is warmer then.

00:05:15.799 --> 00:05:19.799
The only problem is that the kids are back to school then.

00:05:19.799 --> 00:05:25.799
I know. But one good thing about Irish summers is that it doesn't get too hot.

00:05:25.799 --> 00:05:33.799
The average temperature is about 19 degrees and it usually doesn't go above 25 degrees.

00:05:33.799 --> 00:05:37.799
That sounds alright. Now, what about costs?

00:05:37.799 --> 00:05:40.799
Surfing is a pretty cheap holiday really.

00:05:40.799 --> 00:05:43.799
The only cost is the hire of equipment.

00:05:43.799 --> 00:05:50.799
You can expect to pay a daily rate of about 30 euros for the hire of a wetsuit and board.

00:05:50.799 --> 00:05:54.799
But you can save about 40 euros if you hire by the week.

00:05:54.799 --> 00:05:55.799
That's not too bad.

00:05:55.799 --> 00:06:00.799
No. It's important to make sure you get good quality wetsuits.

00:06:00.799 --> 00:06:03.799
You'll all get too cold if you don't.

00:06:03.799 --> 00:06:06.799
And make sure you also get boots.

00:06:06.799 --> 00:06:10.799
They keep your feet warm and it's easier to surf with them on too.

00:06:10.799 --> 00:06:14.799
OK. Well, thanks very much for that.

00:06:24.799 --> 00:06:25.799
Thank you.

00:06:54.799 --> 00:06:59.799
www.circlelineartschool.com

